    lines=["# TrackOCD ICLR 2027 — Phase26 Proposal Source/Candidate Coverage", "",f"**Execution (UTC):** `{decision['execution_time']}`  ","**Gate P2:** **PASS**  ","**Decision:** `P26_GATE_P2_PASS_AUTHORIZE_CORRESPONDENCE`","", "## Result and frozen boundary", "",f"Phase26 preserved the original MOT proposal rows, parent assignment, row keys, causal evaluator and 76-event denominator.  Raw prefix16 true-IoU ceiling is **{raw['ceiling_correct']}/76**; the fixed 27-transform comparator is **38/76** (diagnostic); Phase25 attention top27 is **30/76**.  The single trained class-agnostic source branch reaches **{src['ceiling_correct']}/76**, source reliable **{src['source_reliable_events']}**, target reliable **{src['target_reliable_events']}**, categories **{src['category_coverage']}**, videos **{src['video_coverage']}**, and fold ceilings **{folds}** versus raw **{rawfold}**.  All four folds improve, so the registered Gate P2 passes.","", "Only public TRAIN GT was used for fitting/disjoint validation. DEV+, Q1 and public new-model labels remained sealed; no future rows, IDs, text, StateMemory or controller signal entered the source model.  The broad 48-transform pool reaches **%d/76** only as a diagnostic oracle; it is not a learned result."%broad['ceiling_correct'],"", "## Stage0 source coverage taxonomy", "", "| class | events |", "|---|---:|"]
