    for x in st1["prefix_summary"]: lines.append(f"| {x['prefix']} | {x['raw_ceiling']}/76 | {x['broad_pool_ceiling']}/76 | {x['source_reliable']} | {x['target_reliable']} | {x['category_coverage']} | {x['video_coverage']} |")
    lines += ["", "The broad extension uses scales {0.55,1.00,1.45}, four fixed center shifts and up to four current/past parents.  It is causal and resolution-independent; NMS is not applied to the oracle.","", "## Stage2 source-head training", "", "The source head is a small LayerNorm/linear CLS+ROI plus geometry fusion network.  It emits eight bounded xyxy candidates and quality logits.  Positive TRAIN rows use GT only as supervision; negatives are rows without GT and receive objectness-zero targets.  The model has no category/identity/text/future input.  NMS (IoU 0.7 per parent) and top-K {5,10,20,27} were fixed before held evaluation; raw current-row fallback is retained.","", "| fold | fit rows | val rows | best step | val top27 | generated max IoU | ECE | checkpoint |", "|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|"]
