    lines += ["", "## Stage3 true-IoU validation", "", "| condition | p1 | p2 | p4 | p8 | p16 | source@16 | target@16 | category | video | fold p16 |", "|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|"]
    for c in ["raw_baseline","phase25_attention_top27","phase20_25_fixed_pool","phase26_broad_pool_oracle","phase26_source_branch_topk"]:
        d=st3["conditions"][c]; p=d["prefix16"]; lines.append(f"| {c} | "+" | ".join(f"{x['ceiling_correct']}/76" for x in d["prefix_summary"])+f" | {p['source_reliable_events']} | {p['target_reliable_events']} | {p['category_coverage']} | {p['video_coverage']} | {[x['ceiling_correct'] for x in p['by_fold']]} |")
    lines += ["", "The source branch therefore clears 38/76 and improves both sides and every fixed fold without changing physical MOT.  Structural invariants are exact: the source branch attaches each proposal to an existing parent track; no duplicate physical tracks, fragmentation or parent mismatch is introduced.  The proposal-only interface does not expose MOTA/IDF1/HOTA, so none is claimed.","", "## Gate and conditional correspondence", "", "Gate P2 is **PASS**.  Correspondence is now authorized but not yet performed in this proposal report.  The next independent phase will freeze these source checkpoints, train one multi-positive contrastive + hard-negative + prefix-consistency encoder, then reconnect it to the unchanged Phase19R causal controller.  No threshold, StateMemory, controller architecture, modern backbone or public evaluation is changed/opened by Phase26.","", "## Resources, incidents, storage and sealing", "", "Preflight had 99 GiB available of 125 GiB RAM, GPUs 4–7 idle and about 20 GiB on `/data1`; four bounded workers completed 2,000 updates/fold with BF16 and no OOM.  Launch PIDs and postflight snapshots are in `resource_postflight.json` and `phase26_decision.json`.  The duplicate Stage0 shutdown and before/after hashes are in `duplicate_stage0_shutdown.json`; the old Stage0 artifacts were never modified.  Frozen CSV/features are reused through existing symlinks and no large feature copy was made.","", "## Complete 76-event index", "", "Every prefix16 event is retained in [`full_76_event_summary.csv`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase26/audit/full_76_event_summary.csv); the complete five-prefix records and failure keys are in [`stage3_event_records.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase26/audit/stage3_event_records.json).", "", "## Reproduction", "", "```bash", "PYTHONPATH=. /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase26/run_stage0_audit.py", "PYTHONPATH=. /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase26/run_stage1_source_pool.py", "PYTHONPATH=. /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase26/build_source_manifests.py", "PYTHONPATH=. CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=4 /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase26/train_source_generator.py --fold 0 --device cuda:0 --expected-physical-gpu 4 --smoke --tag source_smoke", "PYTHONPATH=. CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=4 /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase26/train_source_generator.py --fold 0 --device cuda:0 --expected-physical-gpu 4 --steps 10 --batch-size 32 --checkpoint-every 5 --tag source_targeted", "PYTHONPATH=. bash scripts/iclr27_phase26/run_four_fold_source_supervisor.sh", "PYTHONPATH=. /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase26/evaluate_stage3.py --device cpu", "PYTHONPATH=. /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase26/finalize_phase26.py", "```", "", "Phase26 proposal-source stage status: **Gate P2 PASS; proceed to the separately named correspondence stage under the frozen proposal.**"]
    DOC.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True); fd,tmp=tempfile.mkstemp(prefix=f".{DOC.name}.",dir=str(DOC.parent));
