    log=ROOT/"research_log.md"; text=log.read_text(encoding="utf-8") if log.exists() else ""; marker="## Phase 26 proposal source/candidate coverage"; entry=f"\n## Phase 26 proposal source/candidate coverage (2026-08-29)\n\n- Frozen Phase24/25 comparators: raw 25/76, fixed pool oracle 38/76, Phase24 set-aware 32/76, Phase25 attention 30/76.\n- Stage0 source gaps: target 22, source 11, both 5; six pool candidates were missed by Phase25 selection. Stage1 broad causal pool oracle reached {broad['ceiling_correct']}/76 (diagnostic).\n- One class-agnostic source head (eight causal candidates, TRAIN-only GT supervision, BF16, four video/category-disjoint folds on GPUs4-7) reached real {src['ceiling_correct']}/76, source/target {src['source_reliable_events']}/{src['target_reliable_events']}, folds {folds}; Gate **P26_GATE_P2_PASS_AUTHORIZE_CORRESPONDENCE**. No OOM, no sealed-data access.\n- Duplicate Stage0 PIDs were audited; only PID25464 plus diagnostics were terminated, PID26424 exited naturally; hashes and atomic rewrite evidence are recorded.\n- Proposal report: {DOC}\n"; log.write_text(text if marker in text else text+entry,encoding="utf-8")
